window.products.push({"id":455100,"name":"Emerson Essentials Glass Soap Dispenser Set, 2 Pack, Hand Soap Dispenser for Bathrooms and Dish Soap for Kitchen Sink with Pumps, Lotion 16oz Bottles ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yvi7FvGAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VALUE 2 PACK: We home designers are serious when it comes to our soap dispensers. The glass dispensers are crafted from the highest quality glass and can be used for kitchen sink counterops or bathrooms. With it's waterproof features, these dispensers give that professional finishing touch to your home decor. Our selection of bottles include colors of black, white, amber, and clear with various pump options designed to give you the flexibilty you need to complement your home. VERSATILE USE: While other dispensers peel over time, our dispensers are made of premium quality and last far longer. The soap dispensers can hold up to 10 ounces of liquid, which is ideal for fewer refills. Choose from a variety of pump colors including brass, matte black, oil rubbed bronze, brushed gold, matte white, stainless steel, and copper. PREMIUM QUALITY: We only use premium materials. The construction will last and prevents soap or oils from leaking. Unlike others, our pumps are 100% rust-proof stainless steel and designed to resist corrosion. Experience hassle-free filling and cleaning thanks to its screw top bottle opening. The lead-free glass is food safe and interior parts are 100% BPA free. 5 WATERPROOF LABELS: Now with 5 stickers, it's your choice to use the dispners for hand soap, dish wash, lotion, conditioner, or shampoo. To clean, just run the bottle under water and watch any residue simply wash off. With our exclusive no-leak pump, the bottle enables you to put out a good amount of soap with a single pump. U.S.A. BENEFITS: We love and take pride in our produts. Our bottles come with a 10-year Warranty and we are proudly based in the USA. If you’re at all unsatisfied, please contact us and we will resolve the issue.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Yvi7FvGAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emerson Essentials","source_asin":"B09ZKPFC5N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZKPFC5N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZKPFC5N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
