window.products.push({"id":455108,"name":"Santas Secret® Gift - Automatic Christmas Tree Watering System (Peppermint Candy) World's TOP Selling Waterer Since 1998. | Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8111RnBLxkL._AC_SL1452_.jpg","description":"WHAT IS IT? New improved for 2019! Our original Santas Secret Gift is truly elegant around your tree. Its peppermint candy foil design cleverly disguises a fully Automatic Tree Watering System. Now with unlimited watering capacity. It keeps your 'fresh cut' Christmas Tree green, fresh, and safe all season long without the hassle of frequent watering by hand. Operates by Siphon: two containers = seek same liquid level Gallon Jug is user provided (NOT INCLUDED). Operates by Siphon: two containers = seek same liquid level Gallon Jug is user provided (NOT INCLUDED). Convenience of a funnel but without spills, frequent refills, fighting branches, and guesswork. Convenience of a funnel but without spills, frequent refills, fighting branches, and guesswork. Trusted and endorsed by Tree Growers. Trusted and endorsed by Tree Growers. Disguised as a luxury gift while under the tree. No flimsy boxes, buckets, hazardous electric cords or hanging bags! Disguised as a luxury gift while under the tree. No flimsy boxes, buckets, hazardous electric cords or hanging bags! Works with 1 gallon jug(s) for swapping or other larger containers (NOT INCLUDED) Works with 1 gallon jug(s) for swapping or other larger containers (NOT INCLUDED) As seen on ABC News. Made in USA. As seen on ABC News. Made in USA. HOW DOES IT WORK? SIMPLE. EASY. Install pump on container lid, insert probe in tree stand then squeeze starter pump. That's it! Tree is automatically fed with water till jug is emptied. Simply swap with pre-filled jugs or refill container. WHY DO I NEED IT? \"Shut up and take my money!! . . .What a great product! Simple concept, finally someone made an affordable one. My days of crawling under the tree are OVER! My thirsty tree has stayed watered.\" - agray8z \"Amazing and easy. . . .I never write reviews, but this product is wonderful! It's super simple, but very effective at keeping our tree hydrated. . . It's so so much easier than those funnel type products. We have had so many compliments on our tree.\" - Anna L.H.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8111RnBLxkL._AC_SL1452_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Santas Secret","source_asin":"B01N3MRYMH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455108","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N3MRYMH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N3MRYMH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
