window.products.push({"id":455114,"name":"Atomic Clock Large Display, Digital Wall Clock with Indoor Outdoor Temperature and Date, Wireless Outdoor Sensor, Digital Desk Alarm Clock Battery Ope","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hU0l85FmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large LCD Digital Wall Clock with Big Numbers】Easy to Read,The digital clock has a large display with indoor&outdoor temperature（° C/° F）, date, and 12/24 Hour clock modes. And the large display helps you read from any angle in the room. Friendly to the elderly. 【Accurate Atomic Clock – Never Needs Setting】The Atomic clock has a built-in receiver that automatically synchronizes itself with the WWVB radio broadcast by the US Government’s National Institute (NIST) in Fort Collins, Colorado. The Atomic Clock will always be accurate to within one second as it receives daily WWVB updates. 【Atomic Wall Clock with Indoor Outdoor Temperature】The Wireless outdoor sensor (included) transmits the outdoor temperature ( ℃ /℉ optional) the atomic wall clock. The sensor can be placed anywhere within 330ft of the receiving unit. Which means you can put them inside your patio, backyard, garden or courtyard, easily monitor outside conditions without going out. 【Digital Wall Clock Battery Operated】Both of the atomic clock and wireless outdoor sensor are supported by batteries. (Clock needs 3xAA battery, outdoor sensor needs 2xAAA battery, battery not included). There is a low battery indicator display on screen when battery is not power enough, no more worries about forgetting to replace new batteries. 【Table Clock or Wall Clock】The large atomic alarm clock can be hung on the wall or standing on the table (Bracket Included). The bold, simple styled bezel of the clock gives it a modern look, with a classic feel. Perfect for any room in the house, office, bedroom, closet, classroom or living room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hU0l85FmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LFF","source_asin":"B0BY2JCYGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455114","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY2JCYGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY2JCYGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
