window.products.push({"id":455122,"name":"WINEVINCI Reusable Wine Bottle Protector Pack of 4 - Travel Wine Bags for Safe Transportation - The Best Leakproof Wine Bottle Protective Bag - Double","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d2gymUzzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you decide to spend good money on premium wine, champagne, olive oil or the like, you can’t take the risk that the bottle won’t survive the trip home. But it makes no sense to buy single-use bottle sleeves over and over again. THAT'S WHY WE CREATED WINEVINCI With double protection sealed with velcro seam and a dual-zip-locks, WINEVINCI lets you splurge on the most tempting delicacies in complete confidence that you’ll be able to fully enjoy them when you get home. We even made sure that it will fit those champagne bottles with large bottoms! What makes WINEVINCI the toughest protector on the market? Our protectors are padded with two layers of bubble-wrap protection. Other products on the market have only one protective layer. Simple as that. TAKE WINEVINCI ON YOUR NEXT TRIP - IT WON'T LET YOU DOWN","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d2gymUzzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Naava","source_asin":"B076FXLW9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076FXLW9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076FXLW9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":455123,"name":"WÜSTHOF Classic 9\" Bread Knife, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":150.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tn43YaPVL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Wüsthof Classic bread knife, 23 cm is enhanced with a very remarkable serrated pattern. Compared to single-serrated blades, this knife is enhanced with a double-serrated blade. This means that it retains its sharpness longer, doesn't need as much pressure and leaves you with very accurate, smooth cuts. Loaves of bread with a hard crust are not crushed when sliced, and even bread with soft crusts are nicely cut, without tearing the delicate surface. Wüsthof Classic blade: razor-sharp stainless steel The blade made from chromium-vanadium steel (X50CrMoV15) is forged from one solid piece of steel. It is sharpened according to Wüsthof’s PEtec technology. This means that for each blade a sharpening angle is determined with the help of a computer. Afterwards it is precisely sharpened on a wet sharpening stone. After thorough inspection each knife leaves the production line, ready for a life of intensive use. Wüsthof processes the steel in a specific way to make sure it has a high hardness of 58 Rockwell. As such the knife retains its sharpness for a really long time. However, if you notice that the knife is not as sharp as it used to be, all you have to do is move it over a honing steel. The result is a razor-sharp knife that is amazing to use. Wüsthof Classic handle: sustainable and hygienic This knife is a combination of a forged blade and an ergonomic handle made from black POM, a very sustainable type of plastic. The handle can withstand all substances you find in the kitchen. The handle was traditionally and seamlessly riveted to the blade with three rivets. As such dirt can never accumulate in between the blade and the handle. The crop protects your fingers from unnecessary contact with the edge. What more could you possibly ask for? Wüsthof Classic: the classic Wüsthof collection The Classic is the most extensive Wüsthof collection on the market today. It is comprised of over 80 different kitchen knives, amongst which different sizes of chef’s knives, bread knives and carving knives. Because this collection has the most versions of all possible knives, you can easily comprise your own perfect knife set. A knife set with a knife block of chef’s case is, of course, also an option. Both amateur and professional chef’s love working with these kitchen knives. They are enhanced with the NSF hygiene mark.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tn43YaPVL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wüsthof","source_asin":"B085V5TLVF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455123","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085V5TLVF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085V5TLVF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
