window.products.push({"id":455220,"name":"Rozwkeo Artificial Bonsai Tree Fake Plant Decoration Potted Tree Faux House Plants Small Japanese Pine Bonsai Plant for Indoor Home Decoration Office ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fUfgitVIS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A real bonsai takes years to fully grown. This artificial plant fake bonsai never needs to be watered, trimmed or taken out to the sun, gives a touch decor in any space without the work. It also just brightened up your life. Faux Bonsai Plants Material: Is not a natural living plant, it is a artificial plastic plants decoration. Pot is made of plastic with true sand. Size: About 13 inches wide and 7.5 inches tall（Its size is mini actually.） Package Including: 1 x Artificial Potted Plants (Japanese Pine Tree) Wide Application: Perfect decoration for office, home decor, living room, bedroom,dining room,kitchen,study decoration, bookshelf decorative ornaments, windowsill, desk, window, hotel, wedding, party, bar, dressing table,washroom,etc. The shape can be adjusted: When you receive the product at the beginning, it may be different from the picture. That's because it was squeezed during the long journey when it arrived at you, but it doesn’t matter, it can restore shape. Please stretch open the branches and leaves after receiving the goods. Some of the flowers maybe fall off after the long shipping, but please don't worry, the fallen off flowers can be inserted into the vacant place without glue. If it shakes, you need to fix it with glue. Don’t worry, it’s easy, just apply a little glue to the pine roots. After you put them together,you will see a vividly pine bonsai in front of you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fUfgitVIS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rozwkeo","source_asin":"B08ZLLR7LB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZLLR7LB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZLLR7LB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
