window.products.push({"id":455247,"name":"Deconovo Satin Pillowcase Standard Set of 2 - Black Silk Pillowcase for Hair and Skin, 20x26 Inches Bedroom Pillow Covers, Envelope Closure (Black, 20","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Mn3DqV5XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIMUM FABRIC: Made from 100% polyester satin fabric, sturdy and durable with a distinctive and lustrous appearance. Cool to the touch, these silk-like pillowcases are soft and comfortable to sleep on. Each package includes 2 standard size satin pillowcases 20x26 Inches without zipper. HEALTHY FOR SKIN AND HAIR: Our satin pillowcases help to protect against hair-breakage and decrease the frizzies when you getting from sleeping on one side. While maintain the shine of your curly hair and skin after a night's sleep, because this high advanced material won’t absorb moisture and natural oils. ENJOY DEEP SLEEP: We commonly think of sleep as a healing process that melts away the stresses of the day, our satin silky pillowcases will become your perfect choice. They are smooth and wrinkle free to protect your sensitive skin instead of being further irritated at night, have less hair tangle and friction against your face. ENVELOPE CLOSURE: Envelope closure end design prevents your pillows from slipping off during your sweet dream. No zipper, the open end on this pillowcase allows you to fit the pillow into the pillowcase protector easily. CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Machine washable, wash below 86°F. Turn the satin pillow case inside out, place inside a mesh laundry bag, and wash with a mild detergent. Do not bleach, tumble dry low. Iron at low temperature settings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Mn3DqV5XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deconovo","source_asin":"B08Y6W9D5L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y6W9D5L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y6W9D5L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":455248,"name":"GKGOGO Microwave Splatter Cover, Griddle Accessories & Steaming Cover (3 in 1), Microwave Cover with Steam Vent-3 Inch Height, Microwave Plate Cover- ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JI3Le4SsS._AC_.jpg","description":"【EASY TO USE】The microwave plate cover has easy-grip handles and perforated steam vents to allow the moisture to escape. This cover also helps to speed up the cooking process by focusing on the heat of the microwave. And it can keep splatters out of your microwave, no more splatters while cooking, keeps your microwave clean and easy to rinse off or pop in the dishwasher. 【EASY TO STORE】The magnet microwave cover adheres nicely to the top of the microwave without obscuring any vents, put it down when you need to cook and store it at the top of your microwave and on both sides of the microwave after cooking, it stores around the microwave so you don't have to search for it, even don’t need a place to store it. 【SAFE MATERIAL】The microwave magnetic plate cover is made of food-grade silicone which is durable and can be used in the microwave for alone time, BPA FREE & dishwasher safe. But do not use in barbecue mode and do not use in the microwave for longer than 10 minutes continuously while cooking or defrosting. 【SUITABLE SIZE】The microwave splatter cover is 12-inch diameter and 3-inch in height, tall enough and big enough to cover most standard plates. 【PLEASE KINDY NOTE】During Use, please make sure your microwave can work with magnetic, you can use a magnet to see if it can stick with the roof of your microwave. If you have any questions about your purchase, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JI3Le4SsS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GKGOGO","source_asin":"B096NM2HCJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096NM2HCJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096NM2HCJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
