window.products.push({"id":455254,"name":"Star Trek TV Show Logo Discovery - Fleece Throw Blanket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sZpbwtf5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Star Trek: Discovery 36” x 58” fleece throw blanket is an officially licensed product and features our cool TV Show Logo design. This design is printed on one side of a soft 100% polyester fleece blanket. This item is hand-printed in the USA using a dye sublimation printing process that creates slight imperfections over seams and/or folds, which makes each item unique.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sZpbwtf5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Star Trek","source_asin":"B076YMQR6Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076YMQR6Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076YMQR6Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":455255,"name":"BambooKong 3-piece Bamboo Steamer, 10 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811DsvxULVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The BambooKong bamboo steamer can be used to cook anything! It can be used to steam a variety of food like vegetables, fish, dim sum and meat. Bamboo steamers use steam to cook your food, thereby producing fat-free and healthy dishes. Re-create and design your favourite Chinese dishes for you and your family. Bamboo steamers are specifically designed to let steam pass through its porous layers. Steam is allowed to exit the steamer, thereby limiting condensation in the bamboo steamer. This results in nicely steamed food, not soggy and damp after condensation drips onto it (as seen in metal steamers). In addition, our steaming basket is light weight, and can be stored easily as compared to bulky metal steamers. Hand-crafted with an attractive and fancy design, our Chinese steamer can be brought directly from your kitchen into the dining room for serving. By serving food directly in the bamboo steamer, you can retain the high temperature of the steamed food and minimise the need to use and clean further cutlery such as serving plates. Our steamer basket is a 100% natural and eco-friendly product, and is constructed out of high quality bamboo. It measures 10 X 10 X 6.3 inch, and constitutes 2 stackable layers and 1 lid. Its 2-tier design allows for cooking of multiple dishes at the same time, thereby being an efficient and time-saving kitchen tool. It’s ideal size allows it to be large enough for steaming a large quantity of food, yet be small enough for convenient storage. Steaming your food brings about many health benefits. Besides cooking food that is fat-free, steaming enhances a food’s natural flavour and retains nutrients and vitamins. Most importantly, food steamed in a steam basket has its taste retained and at times augmented. Dishes can be easily customised by placing flavoured leaves under the food while steaming, or by mixing the water under the steamer with herbs. Experiment and discover new flavours with our bamboo steamer basket!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811DsvxULVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BambooKong","source_asin":"B01B07UVOG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B07UVOG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B07UVOG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
