window.products.push({"id":455333,"name":"Chardin home Cordural Stripes Bath Mat, Set of 2 Bath Rugs (21 Inches x34 Inches & 24 Inches x40 Inches) | Non Slip Bathroom Rug, Machine Washable, Pl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1HnIa2ftGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton Imported 100% NATURAL COTTON- Step onto plush, spa-like softness with Chardin Home’s all natural, cotton bath mats, styled especially to protect your feet from cold bathroom floors after a shower, but also to protect your floors from moisture and grime. SKID RESISTANCE- You do not have to worry about a bath rug that slips and slides everywhere because this bathmat has been sprayed with all natural latex to improve bathrug grip on slick floors and stop the rug from slipping and sliding around too much. QUICK DRYING- The superior quality cotton yarns wick away water and moisture leaving your bath room dry and usable. Not only is this bath mat highly absorptive but it also dries quicker, protecting your floors from bath water and moisture. SOFT & COZY- With a 1 inch long cut pile, this bath rug will feel luxuriously comfortable every time you walk out of your shower or bath. Make your bathrooms feel like delux, luxury hotel spas. Perfect size for usage by the sink, bathtub or shower stalls and even small half baths or powder rooms VERSATILE USE- Feel free to use these as throw rugs in other areas of your home as well. Perfect for your kitchen, entryway, hallways, bedrooms and anywhere else your heart desires. These soft rugs are also perfect for children’s rooms or for pet use. This exclusive Chardin Home design is available in multiple colors and sizes so you can choose the ones that fit your space. GREAT COLORS- Easy to Match. Get yourself a rug that will match most towels and bath accessories available in the market. These bath rugs feature four different stripes composed of various colors to create an ombre look using color mixing techniques. This bath rugs features a Bluish Grey Stripe, A bluish grey & beige stripe, a beige and Ivory stripe and an Ivory Stripe making the rug look like a Bluish Grey to Beige Ombre EASY CARE- You can machine wash these bath mats SEPARATELY, IN COLD WATER. Always use a MILD SOAP and DO NOT BLEACH. You can TUMBLE DRY on LOW, and remove rug from dryer and shake well when almost dry to prolong life of the rug. DURABLE- These rugs are made with superior quality cotton yarns that are strong and durable. Cotton being a natural fiber will lint in the first few washes; however, with each wash the yarns become stronger & super absorbent. AESTHETIC- From boho chic farmhouse bathrugs to mid-century modern and contemporary designs, find rugs that fit your style and decor perfectly. GREAT GIFT- Great gift idea for all occasions, housewarming, Christmas, Wedding, Father’s Day, Mother’s Day, Valentines, Birthdays, Back to school & more. Great for your home aesthetic for any barbecues, dinner parties, other special occasions or even for everyday use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1HnIa2ftGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chardin home","source_asin":"B01M5EG0MJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455333","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M5EG0MJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M5EG0MJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
