window.products.push({"id":455453,"name":"Zak Designs Flux Khaki Mug, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31E1Y9K259L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Flux mug has a unique large handle, ergonimically designed for perfect handling. Stoneware, Dishwasher Safe, Microwave Safe Amazon.com Delightfully innovative and oh-so-modern, Zak Designs' Flux dinnerware proves that change from the usual can be very good. This set of four 21-ounce mugs pours generous servings of French Roast or Mexican chocolate cocoa with energetic style. On one side, each mug displays a traditional shape with tall sides flared in a smooth outward curve. The other side, however, bows inward instead of out, forming a large \"D\" shape with the outsized, arching handle. At the rim, Flux's signature flared lip appears to create another asymmetrical yet remarkably harmonizing angle. A pleasure to hold from any position-rest the thumb on the flared lip or slip all the fingers around the glossy body-this clever design has a funky look that perfectly suits hip, youthful decors. Flux comes in a fashionable palette of rich neutral tones to mix and match together or to combine with other modern shapes for a freshly eclectic look. Crafted of heavyweight stoneware, this mug set stands up well to heavy use and goes safely into the dishwasher, oven, and microwave. Flux was introduced in 2006 as part of Zak Designs' highly popular Design Collection that includes melamine, ceramic, and polycarbonate dinnerware, serveware, and kitchen prep products. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31E1Y9K259L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zak Designs","source_asin":"B000G66PGG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000G66PGG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000G66PGG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
