window.products.push({"id":455461,"name":"HeYun - Soap Dispenser, 10oz/300ml and 1ml Soap Output, PIR Sensor, Rubber Bottom Waterproof Design Automatic Soap Dispenser for Kitchen and Bathroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519J6XFRVpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Reasonable amount of liquid] The soap dispenser can hold 300ml/10.25oz. Use non-stick soap, laundry detergent, shower gel, shampoo, detergent, etc. (Note: Do not install alcohol, alcohol will corrode the surface color of the body Product.) Ensure that the soap dispenser can output enough liquid to wash your hands (1ml/0.033oz) to Prevent wastage. [Fashionable shape & environmentally material]:The automatic non-contact soap dispenser is made of environmentally-friendly ABS material with unique shape design and smooth silver surface（electroplate）. It is not only beautiful in appearance but also healthy and safe. It is the best choice in office/hospital/kitchen/bathroom. [high-sensitivity sensor and touchless ]The soap dispenser with built-in anti-infrared interference and PIR sensor technology.When you place your hand at a distance of ≥5cm/1.97inch from the liquid outlet, it only takes 0.26S to quickly output liquid. If you need more hand sanitizer, please do not remove your palm, just wait 2S, the soap dispenser will output a fixed amount of liquid again. [IP65 Full-body Waterproof Technology] The soap dispenser have curved neck design allows moisture to flow down the smooth surface to effectively prevent water stains, and the rubber bottom waterproof design can prevent liquid from flowing into the battery box and further prevent battery corrosion。Please do not immerse the soap dispenser in water ,No incline or invert to ensure that it has a longer service life. [Superior Service]: HeYun auto soap dispenser provides superior customer service. Please contact us ,If you have any questions. We offer a worry-free warranty to ensure that you can have a soap dispenser with high-quality. We would help you to solve any problems until you are satisfied. We are provide help at any time for you Battery:4*AAA battery(Not included) Package include: soap dispenser，bracket（Suitable for tile wall）","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519J6XFRVpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"He Yun","source_asin":"B09P575F2H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P575F2H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P575F2H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
