window.products.push({"id":455466,"name":"Somdot Baker’s Rack 35.4\" Wide Kitchen Utility Shelf 3-Tier + 3-Tier Storage Rack for Oven Baker Spice Home Organizer Workstation Microwave Stand, Wal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-ZNZftVDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bulky appliances like your microwave and coffee maker can take up valuable space on your kitchen counters. Free up more space and stay organized with the Somdot Baker's 35.4 Inch Utility Double 3-Tier Microwave Stand. The classic look of this all-purpose shelving is not only stylish but efficient. The organizer is made of open particleboard and has a sturdy metal frame. An X-shaped bracket ensures stability, securely holding appliances on the shelving unit. Heavier items like your microwave, stacks of cookbooks, or piles of pots and pans will all find a spot here on the various tiers. Microwave, mini-oven, and spices shelves are arranged at different heights for a level of variability. S-shaped hooks provide hanging space for various cooking utensils or dry towels. Being both lightweight and having attached wheels, you can freely move this shelf around your living area with all appliances kept in place. This compact piece of furniture is a real all-rounder. Add a relaxed and pleasant atmosphere in the midst of your home. For a durable storage organizer that will save space in your kitchen, living room, bathroom, bedroom, or office, try Somdot's Kitchen Utility Double 3-Tier Microwave Stand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-ZNZftVDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Somdot","source_asin":"B0B94NSK15","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B94NSK15","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B94NSK15","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":455467,"name":"Microvisorhood -a mini hood extension for your microwave over the range -WHITE","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xZnwJt24L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Microvisor is a state of the art mini hood designed to attach to a \"microwave over the range(MOR)\" in order to provide improved exhaust functionality of the existing microwave. The Microwave Over Range is normally 15” deep, and all cooktops/ranges are a minimum of 24” deep, it is virtually impossible to effectively exhaust the fumes from cooking on the front burners. The Microvisor mini hood is 29 7/8\" wide, 1' high at the front and 1 1/2\"high at the back. 8 1/2\" deep. When inserted into the bracket it projects forward of the microwave oven by 6 1/2\" to assist in capturing the smoke, grease and odors off the front cooking surface. The Microvisor mini hood is inserted into the bracket and removed by simply pulling it out, and installs in less than 3 minutes. After 2 years of design and manufacturing prototypes, the Microvisor has been perfected and refined to its present form. It has been proven to capture 70% of the cooking fumes and odors produced while cooking on the front burners of a cooktop or stove. It assists in preventing the smoke, grease and odors from mixing with the air in your home and accumulating on furniture and cabinets by funneling the cooking by products back into the exhaust system of your MOR. It has been proven that fumes from cooking oils escaping into the air of your home are harmful to your health. The Microvisor Hood is removable, easy to store, & no electrical components, no filters, this is \"NOT A MICROWAVE\", BUT AN ADD ON FOR A MICROWAVE OVER THE RANGE\" ***Disclaimer – Some images show Microvisor with branding on the corner. At the request of our customers we have removed this branding.*** Microwaves with a convex or non-flush bottom may require the 5/8\" nylon spacer kit. ****In order to install on Samsung model microwaves or any Samsung microwave with center removable- slide in/out grease filter the \"Samsung Microwave 1\" Spacer Kit-1-0SK\" will need to be purchased along with the Microvisorhood","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xZnwJt24L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Microvisorhood","source_asin":"B01GVYYPHC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455467","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GVYYPHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GVYYPHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":455468,"name":"Large 8 Inch 2 Pack Air Fryer Silicone Liners Pot, Round Silicone Air Fryer Basket Baking Tray, Apply to 3.2-6.5 QT Airfryer, Reusable Cooking Oven In","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YPkqtgLML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Big Size: top diameter: 8 inches, bottom diameter: 6.5 inches; height: 2.4 inches. (suitable for 3.2 to 6.5 QT or bigger air fryers.) Convenient: Lining a round air fryer silicone bowl mat, make you enjoy delicious and healthy foods(easy to clean: dishwasher and microwave safe). More Economical: The reusable air fryer silicone pot is more environmentally friendly and saves more than flammable disposable air fryer parchment paper liners. Food Grade Silicone Material: Non-stick, high-temperature heat resistant up to 464 ℉ (240℃). 24 hours at your service: If you have any questions about the product, please contact us, we will solve the return and exchange questions for you in time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YPkqtgLML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"J.Y.Memorize","source_asin":"B0BXSKM9VC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455468","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXSKM9VC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXSKM9VC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
