window.products.push({"id":455510,"name":"Ball Wide Mouth Canning Jars Kit | 32oz Quart Wide Mouth Mason Jars and Lids (12) | Bundle of Ball Canning Jars, Funnel, Jar Opener, Labels | Canning,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OE045KZeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUART BALL JARS STARTER KIT: A great kit for gifting or for the newcomer to canning. Our KanBandz kit includes 12 x Quart mason jar wide mouth for a variety of canning and preserving options, extra wide mouth plastic funnel transfers large quantities of liquids or dry ingredients with less spills and mess, and self stick labels for identifying and dating your canned goods. Also included is our KangarooBands rubber jar opener. BALL WIDE MOUTH QUART MASON JAR: Ball Wide Mouth jars are best for whole fruits and vegetables but are ideal too for canning salsas, syrups, sauces, fruits, vegetables, and juices. They can even be used to keep small, non-food items such as art and craft supplies, office stationery and much more. Put them on a wall filled for the perfect Home Décor! STURDY CONSTRUCTION: Ball Mason jars are made in USA of Highest quality glass. The Reusable glass Mason jars are BPA-free, dishwasher and freezer safe. They are designed with 2-piece lid closures and bands ensuring an airtight seal. Jars are embossed with measurements for accurate filling - doubling as measuring cups for cooking and baking. PERFECT SEAL FOR CANNER: When it comes to canning, there's nothing more important than a quality seal. The lids and bands ensures that no oxygen gets into the canning jar after processing and that your food will remain preserved just the way you created it. Refrigerate up to 3 weeks, freeze up to 1 year, fresh preserve and store up to 1 year GREAT FOR GIFTING: Our ball wide mouth mason jars will arrive well packaged making them a perfect home warming, holiday, birthday or welcome to canning gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OE045KZeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KANBANDZ","source_asin":"B0B9ZJCYMR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455510","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9ZJCYMR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9ZJCYMR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":455511,"name":"Sheer Curtains for Living Room Embroidered Design Grommets Top Embroidery Curtains for Bedroom 2 Panels 95 inches Long White & Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lWWGbCp4S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ready made: Thick sheer window curtains create soft sunlight streaming in, texture provide a decent measure of privacy Nice design: Grommet top style showcases modern look and simple installation, fits perfectly with standard curtain rods and pulls open/close easily. Perfect size: Each panel of our curtains measures a 55\" width, 2 pieces reach a combined width of 108\", enough to cover any window and decorate the proper part of a wall. Top notch fabric: Dense heavy, no wrinkled, neat seams, machine washable to easy care Widely use: Suitable for Infant room, basement, bedroom, living room and other windows, for a privacy protection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lWWGbCp4S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"jinchan","source_asin":"B07FL6ZTYD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455511","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FL6ZTYD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FL6ZTYD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":455512,"name":"Simply Charmed Crystal Magnetic Wine Glass Charms for Stemless Glasses, Champagne Flutes & More – Set of 6 Jewel Colors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ykdjTJpJL._AC_.jpg","description":"CLEVER GIFT FOR ANY WINE LOVER: Whether you love to host and entertain or know someone who does, these unique wine glass markers make a memorable impression at any event. We have heard from many delighted wine enthusiasts that the crystal identifiers were “Great conversation starters” and “The hit of the party!” PERFECT GIFT FOR ANY OCCASION: Our set of 6 Jewel toned authentic Swarovski Crystal Elements arrives directly from Amazon in an elegant clear pillow package. They make a great housewarming gift for couples or any new home, a lovely hostess gift, or great birthday gift for your wife, husband, sister, friend, aunt or uncle. Pair with a bottle of cabernet sauvignon for a romantic Valentines Day or anniversary gift. WHY MAGNETIC CHARMS? Simply Charmed's modern glass charms solve 2 problems encountered with regular hoop markers: they do not dangle or clank when you take a drink, and they work on the ever so popular stemless wine glasses. They even work on martini glasses, champagne flutes & beer mugs, whether they are made of acrylic, Tritan, copper or stainless steel. HANDCRAFTED IN THE USA: Our small family owned business hand crafts our charms in the Midwest. We have been pleasing discerning shoppers that enjoy using and gifting quality memorable items for over 5 years. Our mission: To ignite conversation and create experiences amongst wine enthusiasts, new acquaintances, or old friends with two strong magnets and one small charm, which also serve to identify your drink . COMMITTED TO EXCELLENCE: From day 1 we have chosen to create the best quality wine accessories possible. We expanded our designs in response to our customers’ requests for specific themes such as St. Patricks Day, Thanksgiving, and wedding & bridal gift sets. We are confident our charms will delight your guests, but if not, just contact us for a full refund or replacement. So with that guarantee, add a set of charms to your cart now, and select a nice bottle of wine for when they arrive. Cheers!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ykdjTJpJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simply Charmed","source_asin":"B00EZDV9IK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455512","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EZDV9IK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EZDV9IK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
