window.products.push({"id":455605,"name":"Amagic LED Tea Lights Flameless Candle with Remote, Replacement Batteries Included, Small Battery Operated Tealight Candle Unscented, Warm White Flick","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516ZPHx-nCL._AC_.jpg","description":"(12 Pack) AMAGIC LED Tea Lights Flameless Candle with REMOTE, 2-dozen Bonus Replacement Batteries Included Are they as realistic as the candle with the moving wick? No. But you can’t beat the PRICE , since normally the BATTERIES for these cost so much and they come with a REMOTE CONTROL! Amagic 12 pack flameless battery operated tea lights give you all of the ambiance and realism of traditional open-flame candles without any of the usual drawbacks.  Enjoy the romantic glow of dancing, flickering flames without unpleasant scents or waxy odors, or the inconvenience of wax that trickles onto surfaces. Feel free to leave AMAGIC tea lights with remote unattended in any room, even in the presence of children and pets, without concern that an open flame could cause burns or fires.  Amagic tea lights open a world of possibilities for decorating and entertaining. PRODUCT DETAILS: 1. Material: LED+PP.  2. Size: Diameter 3.6cm/1.4inch+ Height 3.2cm/1.25inch. 3. Function:  Flickering: Yes Come with a REMOTE CONTROL 4. Battery: CR2032 button cell 5. Battery life: 80 hours for 24 batteries (including 2 set) 6. Light color: Warm White WHAT'S INCLUDED: 12 X Flameless Tea Lights 24 X CR2032 batteries  1 X Remote Control UNIQUE DECOR IDEAS, IDEAL FOR : ✔Wedding  ✔Christmas/ Halloween/ Thanksgiving Day/ Father's Day/ Mother's Day Decoration ✔Birthday Parties ✔As mood lights night lights for Special nights, romantic dinners ✔Nice size to fit in a votive holder ✔Ambient nights in the lanterns, garden Note: ***** Note:Using the remote will shorten battery life, as they use battery to stay active, enabling to receive signal even when the candles are turned off with remote. Therefore, if you are not using these candles for a long time, pls switch them to the \"OFF\" manually.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516ZPHx-nCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amagic","source_asin":"B0793NMJ6H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455605","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0793NMJ6H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0793NMJ6H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":455606,"name":"Handheld Steamer Iron for Clothes/Fabric, 1800W Travel Size Garment Steamer, 20s Heat Up Professional Steamer Anti-wrinkle with LCD Smart Screen,2 Ste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jaxwULAjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Garment steamer is a powerful hand-held fabric steamer/clothing steamer. The high-definition intelligent LCD screen saves ironing time and is a must-have product for an efficient life. Exclusive 1800W steam flow provides hot steam and produces results quickly. Newly upgraded rapid warm-up time-just plug it in and be ready in 20 seconds or less. Why choose our multi-functional advanced handheld steamer The steamer is safe and easy to use, does not iron clothes, and is suitable for all fabrics, such as cotton, linen, silk, polyester, wool, velvet, curtains, bed sheets and other common blended fabrics. Say goodbye to stubborn folds! It can be used at any angle, allowing you to steam your clothes when placed horizontally or hung vertically. Specifications: Powerful power: 1800w Safety voltage: 100-120V Fast heating: 15 seconds Large water tank: 350ml 2 Steam mode: medium or high, you can choose when removing deep or fine wrinkles. Compact size: 11.7in*8.7in, exquisite design, ideal for travel and business. Q:Why steamer is not producing the steam? A:1. Fill the water tank below the MAX water level line, make sure the plug is properly connected, and wait for 20 seconds to warm up; 2. After ensuring that the water pressure is in place, press the LCD screen to select the mode; 3. Toggle the front button to lock the fog to be used normally; When pumping water, 100% check whether the pump is working and whether the pressure value is normal. 4. Then, check whether the atomization button on the back is always on. When it becomes constant, fog can be emitted. There is no fog when the electric heating pot is plugged in. After the back button changes from flashing intermittently to a constant light, turn the front dial to turn the button to release the mist.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jaxwULAjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homuserr","source_asin":"B09MRJNK7Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455606","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MRJNK7Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MRJNK7Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
