window.products.push({"id":455708,"name":"Tonko Louis Armstrong Poster - Low Poly Portrait - Modern Wall Art - Bedroom Decoration for Women Men (Polygonal, 11x14)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aCHMzAvnS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are there any fans of jazz music over here? Maybe you know somebody who is? Because we have something special for you, guys: it's a cool modern poster with the portrait of Louis Armstrong. Our Louis Armstrong poster stands out from other bedroom prints thanks to its sophisticated art style. It's a low poly portrait, created with the help of digital graphics. The image is made up of geometric shapes with deliberately prominent borders between them; and this adds a special charm to the poster. Don't worry about how to hang this Louis Armstrong print. You can easily do that with just a few thumbtacks or some tape. Alternatively, you can frame the print first and then put it up on a wall just like an actual painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aCHMzAvnS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tonko","source_asin":"B093YDSP8X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093YDSP8X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093YDSP8X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":455709,"name":"Evolur Aurora Hutch/Bookcase in Dusty Rose","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":416.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H1BZHomoL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Once upon a time, there was a whimsical fairytale nursery collection that was inspired and designed by Evolur. This Victorian style hutch incorporates soft feminine carving, crystal and metal knobs, Queen Anne style feet, and a delicate ribbon and bow scrollwork, which creates a room as if taken straight from the pages of a fairytale. The Evolur Aurora hutch features one fixed upper-shelf and one lower removable shelf which can be adjusted while using the double dresser as a changing surface by adding a contour pad (sold separately).The Aurora hutch base can be remove and attached to the Aurora double dresser. This dual-purpose hutch is design to make baby changing easier; simply place your go to baby changing essentials on the shelves and you are ready for every single changing occasion. This multiple function hutch can also be use in other areas in the home for keepsakes, pictures frames, books and beautiful decorations. The Evolur Aurora hutch is available in beautiful and elegant finishes which is ideal for any decor to create and inspire a happily ever after your child will adore.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H1BZHomoL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Evolur","source_asin":"B09M7JLPDW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M7JLPDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M7JLPDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":455710,"name":"Cokunst Air Fryer Oven 7.4 Quart 1500-Watt Electric Airfryer for Roasting/Baking/Grilling, with Digital Touch Screen, Oil Free Nonstick Basket, 8 Cook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qUz7L9V4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Versatile Cooker: this air fryer can be used as oven, fryer, toaster, grill, dehydrator, microwave, sandwich maker, nonstick frying pan, popcorn maker and more, with programmable temperature control from 100℉~400℉ to satisfy your different needs of cooking. Easy to Use: Cokunst air fryer adopts humanized digital touch display, touch the icon instead of keeping circling to choose cooking mode. The 8 cooking presets allow you to air-fry extra crispy chicken wings or delicious kebabs without any difficult. The nonstick basket is dishwasher safe, easy to clean. Healthy Way for Delicious Food: up to 80% less oil than traditional deep frying methods. Cokunst air fryer adopts new technology of frying food by 360° hot air circulation, no extra oil required when cooking meats, so you can enjoy the delicious taste in a healthy way. Cook for Family Meals: Cokunst air oven is designed with large 7.4 quart/7 liter capacity for small parties & big family meals; the 1500Watt high power with the innovative dynamic airflow technology can save almost 30% of time to finish cooking the meals, compared to a conventional oven. Build for Safety: safety over-heating protection; automatically shut off and ready signal when cooking complete. Safety power cut off function when the basket base is detached. The cool-touch handle prevent accidental detachment and touching of hot surfaces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qUz7L9V4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COKUNST","source_asin":"B086MBWG3H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086MBWG3H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086MBWG3H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
