window.products.push({"id":455766,"name":"NesTidy Navy Velvet Hangers 60 Pack, 17.5 Inch Navy Felt Hangers Non Slip Space Saving, Clothes Hangers for Closet with 360 Degree Swivel Hook, Flocke","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yD-VGsc8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👔Why Not Try to Make Wardrobe More Elegant: 60 pack velvet hangers are made of 2022 improved premium quality ABS plastic, and are all covered with non-slip but soft and plush velvet surface. Shiny chrome hook on the top of each felt hanger, undoubtedly makes your wardrobe even more unique and luxurious. 👕Save More Than 50% Space: 0.2-Inch Ultra-slim designed non slip hangers from NesTidy, can helps you pack your closet to its limit. For those shopping lover with a taste for clothes, it also means you can be rest assured to hang more clothes in the closet with our velvet hangers. 🧥Surprise & Convenience: Despite the ultra-slim design, premium material and stable structure make each flocked hanger strong enough to hold up 12 pounds. You will find that heavy sweaters and winter clothes are just a piece of cake for them. Besides, each velvet coat hangers has a shoulder line contour design that can help to preserve the shape of clothes well and protect clothes from getting wrinkled. 👗Multifunctional Navy Velvet Hangers: Particularly useful for hanging shirts, suits, blouses, sweaters and jackets, etc. Two notches on the shoulder of each velvet clothes hangers also can be used for hanging ties, belts and more, without any slip. Moreover, you can find that our felt hanger features a horizontal bar at the bottom that allows you to hang a variety of pants and is also convenient for you to quickly match with your tops. 👚NesTidy Service & Tips: NesTidy has an professional customer care team and excellent customer service, so if you encounter any issue with our product, please contact us at any time, we are always at your service and will help you up and turn things around. \"Tips\": Before the first use, we recommend to rinse the hanger in cold water for 20-25 seconds to remove excess residue, and then turn the hook lightly to engage the swivel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yD-VGsc8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NesTidy","source_asin":"B08RWGKGKD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RWGKGKD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RWGKGKD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
