window.products.push({"id":455816,"name":"SlipX Solutions Adhesive Daisy Bath Treads Add Non-Slip Traction to Tubs, Showers, Pools, Boats, Stairs & More (18 Pieces, Reliable Grip, Purple)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HXPbMww7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Improve traction in the bathtub, shower or other slippery spot with SlipX Solutions Adhesive Daisy Bath Treads. Made of high-quality vinyl, their playful design utilizes a textured surface pattern to provide peace of mind underfoot. To install, clean surface carefully using everyday cleanser. Dry completely. Wipe surface with rubbing alcohol to remove any soap/cleanser residue. Dry completely. Remove backing material one tread at a time. Press each tread firmly onto surface, working from center outward. Make sure all outer edges firmly attach to surface. Do not touch adhesive or reposition treads during installation. Allow newly installed treads to stand for 12 hours before use.WARNING: Designed for use on smooth surfaces only. For your safety, do not install over grout lines, voids or textured/uneven surfaces; all of which negatively affect adhesion. Removal may damage refinished surfaces. Always use caution when entering or exiting the tub, shower or other slippery areas. No anti-slip product can prevent all accidents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HXPbMww7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SlipX Solutions","source_asin":"B08R7Y3HH1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R7Y3HH1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R7Y3HH1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
