window.products.push({"id":455902,"name":"Kitchen Mats and Rugs for Floor - Non Skid Washable Kitchen Floor Mat for in Front of Sink - Waterproof Farmhouse Style Kitchen Carpet - Comfort Kitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZysdQkEdS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Topnotch Quality for Better Kitchen Experience: Premium kitchen rug is made of high-quality nonwoven fabrics that are soft, durable, and guaranteed to last a long time. This kitchen mat provides excellent cushioning, which reduces discomfort in the feet especially when spending long hours standing. The colorfast twill fabric does not fade even with repeated washing and cleaning. Non-Slip, Non-Skid: User safety is a top priority. Specifically designed to prevent slipping, this kitchen floor mat features a high-quality non-skid underneath that provides a better grip to avoid any kitchen floor accidents. Its anti-skid characteristic makes this rug a perfect kitchen sink mat as it stays in place when used despite water and cooking oil spills. This rug has enough traction to work well on both dry and wet surfaces. Highly Absorbent: This kitchen mat is among the most absorbent rugs you can find in the market today. Constructed using absorbent fibers that soak up various types of liquid such as water and oil, saving you a lot of time in cleaning and drying the floor. It easily traps dirt and mud, making it also an ideal option for a doormat. Easy to Clean: Forget the hassle of hand washing because this waterproof kitchen mat is machine-washable. Just add some of your favorite detergents and run the washing machine as you normally would. The thick will fabric used is also safe in the drier. In no time your kitchen sink rug is clean and ready to use again. Versatile and Practical: More than just a floor mat! Besides being used as a kitchen and doormat, this doubles as an accent rug that will surely illuminate any bare spot in your living room and bedroom. It comes in neutral colors such as brown and grey, which easily match the aesthetics of your home. With its ideal size, this comfort mat is versatile enough to add warmth and flavor to your kitchen or any part of your house.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZysdQkEdS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOVE YOU Studio","source_asin":"B0929Y31K9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-455902","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0929Y31K9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0929Y31K9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
